# Copy to frontend/.env (never commit .env). NONE of these are secrets and no API key is required.
# Basemap tile server (default = OpenStreetMap standard tiles; fine for a low-traffic academic demo,
# see https://operations.osmfoundation.org/policies/tiles/). Swap for a provider you are entitled to use.
# VITE_TILE_URL=https://tile.openstreetmap.org/{z}/{x}/{y}.png
# Attribution required by the chosen provider (HTML allowed). Default comes from the backend: OpenStreetMap contributors.
# VITE_TILE_ATTRIBUTION=&copy; <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright">OpenStreetMap</a> contributors
# NOTE: anything prefixed VITE_ is embedded in the public JavaScript bundle. Never put a private key here.
